{"material_id":"mat_084c8d1c3271","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"rs34l7aa23mk54jutma8f7g3r","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：Arena (@arena)","author_followers":null,"title":"Arena 完成 2 亿美元 B 轮融资，估值 31 亿美元并发布 Alignment Index","excerpt":"Arena 完成 2 亿美元 B 轮融资，估值 31 亿美元，由 Lightspeed 和 Khosla Ventures 联合领投，a16z、Felicis、Salesforce Ventures、The House Fund 等参投。自 A 轮以来，Arena 年化收入超 1 亿美元，平台累计 3.5 亿场次会话，约 5 个月内产生 700 万次 Agent Arena 会话，覆盖文本、视觉、代码、搜索、图像和视频的投票达 6200 万，用户遍布 150 多个国家。融资同时，Arena 发布基于真实智能体轨迹构建的 Alignment Index，对 20 多个前沿模型从 Unauthorized Action、False Attribution 和 Deceptive Completion 三个信号进行评估。Arena 于 2023 年作为 UC Berkeley 研究项目启动，2025 年成为公司。","source_url":"https://x.com/arena/status/2108310714423423254","canonical_url":"https://x.com/arena/status/2108310714423423254","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-10-08T21:36:59.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-10-09T07:13:14.617Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"accepted","rejection_reasons":[],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：Arena (@arena)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["actionable_update","ai_basics","ai_news","content_and_video"],"relevance_score":60,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":73,"fingerprint":"084c8d1c327197ad50163e25a364c9d7edfc9b15d64e2d9ea9645daa5b1f4724","content_fingerprint":"8b1933e03e578139110e57da3c8ef2625144844bc53c151d2e2ca0640fba8e0e"}
